  title: "Gift of the House of Stars"
  fullText: "Elves of the House of Stars bar the road, their cloaks shimmering like the night sky. Their lady holds out a small box wrapped in silver thread. \"A gift, traveller. From the stars to you.\" Her smile does not reach her eyes.\n\nWhat will you do?"
